plier is used.\n\nKnockback distance and stun duration are based on Morphling's strength. If his strength is 50% higher than his agility, the maximum knockback distance and stun duration is used.", "notes_zh": ["弹道移动速度为%projectile_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_base", "damage_min", "damage_max", "stun_min", "stun_max", "knockback_min", "knockback_max", "knockback_duration", "projectile_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "morphling_morph_agi", "name_zh": "变体精灵·属性变换（敏捷获取）", "name_en": "Attribute Shift (Agility Gain)", "description_zh": "变体精灵改变它的形态，将一些力量以%morph_rate%点/秒的速率转化成敏捷。该过程可逆。", "description_en": "Morphling shifts its form, pulling points from Strength and pouring them into Agility at a rate of %morph_rate%. The process is reversible.", "notes_zh": ["属性变换不能转化物品提供的属性加成。", "升级敏捷获取时也会升级力量获取。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "变体精灵在眩晕状态下可以变换属性。降低魔法消耗。", "en": "Morphling can shift attributes while stunned. Reduces mana cost."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["points_per_tick", "morph_rate", "mana_cost", "castable_while_stunned"]}, {"subject": "morphling_morph_str", "name_zh": "变体精灵·属性变换（力量获取）", "name_en": "Attribute Shift (Strength Gain)", "description_zh": "变体精灵改变它的形态，将一些敏捷以%morph_rate%点/秒的速率转化成力量。该过程可逆。", "description_en": "Morphling shifts its form, pulling points from Agility and pouring them into Strength at a rate of %morph_rate%. The process is reversible.", "notes_zh": ["属性变换不能转换物品提供的属性加成。", "升级力量获取时也会升级敏捷获取。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "变体精灵在眩晕状态下可以变换属性。降低魔法消耗。", "en": "Morphling can shift attributes while stunned. Reduces mana cost."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["points_per_tick", "morph_rate", "mana_cost", "castable_while_stunned"]}, {"subject": "morphling_replicate", "name_zh": "变体精灵·变形", "name_en": "Morph", "description_zh": "使自身向敌方目标改变，获得其基础技能，并且基于目标改变自己的主属性。技能持续时间内可以来回切换。", 