发动攻击后，幻影长矛手将快速向其冲去，获得移动速度和闪避提升。", "description_en": "When targeting an enemy for an attack, Phantom Lancer quickly charges into range, gaining increased movement speed and evasion.", "notes_zh": ["如果冲锋中途取消攻击指令，那么移动速度加成就会消失。", "冲锋过程中移动速度为%bonus_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升距离。每当幻影长矛手冲锋时穿过敌人，他就会制造并列幻象攻击他们。另外，每冲锋%illusion_spawn_travel_distance%距离还会在幻影长矛手身旁制造一个并列幻象，向目标冲去。", "en": "Increases Range. Whenever Phantom Lancer Rushes through enemies, he creates Juxtapose illusions that attack them. Additionally, every %illusion_spawn_travel_distance% units rushed creates a Juxtapose illusion that rushes to the target alongside Phantom Lancer."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["min_distance", "max_distance", "bonus_speed", "illusion_spawn_radius", "illusion_spawn_travel_distance", "evasion", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "phantom_lancer_illusory_armaments", "name_zh": "幻影长矛手·灵幻兵械", "name_en": "Illusory Armaments", "description_zh": "幻影长矛手只要制造出幻象，该幻象的继承攻击力不会低于一定值，持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Whenever an illusion of Phantom Lancer is created, its outgoing damage cannot go below a fixed value for %duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["outgoing_floor", "duration"]}, {"subject": "phantom_lancer_juxtapose", "name_zh": "幻影长矛手·并列", "name_en": "Juxtapose", "description_zh": "幻影长矛手的攻击有一定几率使自己的存在破碎，产生自身的幻象。幻象也有几率进一步破碎，再产生幻象。幻影长矛手产生的幻象持续%illusion_duration%秒，幻象产生的幻象则持续%illusion_from_illusion_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Phantom Lancer has a chance to fracture his presence on an attack, creating an illusion of himself. Illusions also have a chance to fracture further. Illusions created from Phantom Lancer last for %illusion_duration% seconds, while illusions created from other illusions last %illusion_from_illusion_duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "并列增加主动技能。使幻影长矛手进入隐身，最多持续%invis_duration%秒，同时产生一个复制幻象来迷惑敌人。隐身期间自身移动速度提升%invis_movespeed%%%。", "en": "Adds an active ability to Juxtapose. Renders Phantom Lancer invisible for up to %invis_duration% seconds while generating a duplicate image to confuse enemies. His movement speed is increased by %invis_movespeed%%% during this invisibility."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["max_illusions", "proc_chance_pct", "illusion_proc_chance_pct", "illusion_duration", "illusion_from_illusion_duration", "illusion_damage_out_pct", "tooltip_illusion_damage", "illusion_damage_in_pct", "tooltip_total_illusion_damage_in_pct", "shard_bonus_illusions", "invis_duration", "invis_movespeed", "uncontrollable_illusions", "new_target_radius", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "puck_illusory_orb", "name_zh": "帕克·幻象法球", "name_en": "Illusory Orb", "description_zh": "以矢量为目标。帕克向路线方向发出一个魔法球，对经过路径上的敌人造成伤害。法球每%damage_interval%秒会在作用范围内额外造成%damage_over_time_pct%%%击中伤害，但超过最大施法距离后法球会被摧毁。\n\n在幻象法球飞行过程中，帕克可以使用灵动之翼来传送到法球所在的位置。可以设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标），让法球的路线为向前的直线。", "description_en": "Vector Targeted. Puck launches a magic orb that travels along the path, damaging enemy units along the way. The orb deals an additional %damage_over_time_pct%%% of its impact damage every %damage_interval%s in its area of effect, but if it exceeds the max cast range it will be destroyed.\n\n At any point, Puck may teleport to the orb's location using Ethereal Jaunt. Can be put on alt-cast to launch the Orb straight ahead.", "notes_zh": ["幻象法球在飞行途中提供顺畅视野。", "将自己传送到幻象法球可以躲避攻击和技能弹道。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "max_distance", "orb_speed", "orb_vision", "vision_duration", "damage", "warning_sound_time", "curve_orb", "curve_orb_duration_multiplier", "curve_orb_max_acceleration", "curve_orb_pullback_bonus_launch_speed", "curve_strength", "vector_reticle_distance", "damage_over_time_pct", "damage_interval"]}, {"subject": "puck_waning_rift", "name_zh": "帕克·新月之痕", "name_en": "Waning Rift", "description_zh": "帕克传送至目标地点洒出它神秘的仙女粉尘，对周围的敌人造成伤害和沉默。", "description_en": "Puck teleports to the target location and releases a burst of faerie dust that deals damage and silences enemy units nearby.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "silence_duration", "damage", "max_distance", "push_pull_enabled", "knock_distance", "knock_duration", "pull_distance", "pull_duration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "puck_phase_shift", "name_zh": "帕克·相位转移", "name_en": "Phase Shift", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 帕克暂时将自己转移到另一个位面，从而免疫伤害。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Puck briefly shifts into another dimension where it is immune from harm.", "notes_zh": ["帕克在相位转移状态下依然具有碰撞体积。", "进行任何动作都会中止相位转移。", "帕克在相位转移状态下无敌。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "帕克的攻击造成额外魔法伤害。帕克每次施放相位转移时对攻击距离内所有敌人发动一次攻击。", "en": "Puck's attacks deal bonus magic damage. Puck attacks all enemies within its attack range every time it phase shifts."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "shard_attack_range_bonus", "shard_bonus_damage", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "puck_puckish", "name_zh": "帕克·顽皮克敌", "name_en": "Puckish", "description_zh": "每当帕克躲避攻击时，它就会分别回复最大生命值和最大魔法值的%mana_and_health_restore_pct%%%。躲避指向性技能的弹道将回复%dodged_spell_multiplier%倍数值。防御塔的攻击不会对此生效。", "description_en": "Whenever Puck disjoints an attack, it restores %mana_and_health_restore_pct%%% of its max health and mana. Dodging a targeted spell projectile restores %dodged_spell_multiplier%x that amount. Does not apply to attacks by Towers.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["mana_and_health_restore_pct", "dodged_spell_multiplier"]}, {"subject": "puck_dream_coil", "name_zh": "帕克·梦境缠绕", "name_en": "Dream Coil", "description_zh": "创造一个变化无常的的魔法梦境来困住敌方英雄，对他们造成伤害和束缚。如果被困住的敌方英雄试图挣脱缠绕走出梦境，将因为梦境破碎而受到眩晕和额外伤害。", "description_en": "Creates a coil of volatile magic that latches onto enemy Heroes, damaging and leashing them.  If the enemy hero stretches the coil by moving too far away, it snaps, stunning and dealing additional damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "梦境缠绕作用下的所有敌人都会被帕克攻击，攻击频率基于帕克攻击频率的%attack_rate_pct%%%。即使目标挣脱梦境，被眩晕时攻击也会继续。", "en": "All enemies affected by Dream Coil are attacked at a rate equal to %attack_rate_pct%%% of Puck's attack rate. The attacks continue while the target is stunned if they break the Dream Coil."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["coil_duration", "coil_break_radius", "stun_duration", "coil_initial_damage", "coil_stun_duration", "coil_break_damage", "coil_radius", "coil_rapid_fire_rate", "coil_rapid_fire_z_offset", "attack_rate_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "pudge_meat_hook", "name_zh": "帕吉·肉钩", "name_en": "Meat Hook", "description_zh": "向一个单位或方向射出血腥的肉钩。勾住第一个遭遇的单位，并将它拖到帕吉身边，如果是非远古单位会被秒杀，其他敌方单位则是受到伤害。", "description_en": "Launches a bloody hook toward a unit or location. The hook will snag the first unit it encounters, dragging the unit back to Pudge, killing it if it's a non-ancient creep and dealing damage if it is an enemy otherwise.", "notes_zh": ["钩中敌人后将打断持续施法类技能。", "肉钩能击中隐身单位。", "肉钩可以穿过树木、地形、建筑、远古生物和肉山。", "肉钩可以拖拽友方单位，不过他们不会受到伤害。", "肉钩可以将神符拖拽至帕吉身旁，并返还肉钩的魔法消耗。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "肉钩击中敌人时会根据牵引距离造成额外伤害。肉钩击中友军时，肉钩的冷却时间会减少%cooldown_reduction_pct_allied_hook%%%。", "en": "When Meat Hook hits an enemy, it deals bonus damage based on the distance pulled.When Meat Hook hits an ally, Meat Hook's cooldown is reduced by %cooldown_reduction_pct_allied_hook%%%."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "hook_speed", "hook_width", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "distance_to_damage", "min_distance_damage", "cooldown_reduction_pct_allied_hook", "self_stun_duration_percent", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "pudge_rot", "name_zh": "帕吉·腐烂", "name_en": "Rot", "description_zh": "能够造成持续伤害并减缓敌人移动速度的毒性云雾——同时对敌军和自身造成伤害。", "description_en": "A toxic cloud that deals intense damage and slows movement--harming not only enemy units but Pudge himself.", "notes_zh": ["使用腐烂不会打断持续施法。", "腐烂能伤害隐身单位。", "即使帕吉在开启腐烂后被沉默，腐烂也不会关闭。", "腐烂的对己伤害不致死。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "腐烂的作用范围提升%bonus_rot_radius%，伤害提升%bonus_rot_damage%点，并且可以降低敌人的%scepter_rot_regen_reduction_pct%%%生命回复。", "en": "Increases Rot radius by %bonus_rot_radius%, damage by %bonus_rot_damage%, and causes it to reduce enemy Health Restoration by %scepter_rot_regen_reduction_pct%%%."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["rot_radius", "rot_tick", "rot_slow", "rot_damage", "scepter_rot_regen_reduction_pct"]}, {"subject": "pudge_flesh_heap", "name_zh": "帕吉·肉盾", "name_en": "Meat Shield", "description_zh": "帕吉用一层血肉包裹自己，可以格挡所有来源的所有类型伤害。", "description_en": "Pudge covers himself with a layer of flesh that blocks damage of any type taken from any source.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_block", "duration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "pudge_innate_graft_flesh", "name_zh": "帕吉·腐肉堆积", "name_en": "Flesh Heap", "description_zh": "每次帕吉击杀敌方英雄时，他的皮肤就会永久变厚，获得的每层叠加效果为%flesh_heap_strength_buff_amount%点额外力量。", "description_en": "Pudge's skin thickens permanently every time he kills an enemy Hero, gaining %flesh_heap_strength_buff_amount% bonus Strength for each stack.", "notes_zh": ["帕吉附近%flesh_heap_range%范围内敌方英雄阵亡时他都会获得一层叠加效果，不论击杀者是谁。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["flesh_heap_strength_buff_amount", "flesh_heap_range"]}, {"subject": "pudge_dismember", "name_zh": "帕吉·肢解", "name_en": "Dismember", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 帕吉撕咬一个敌方单位，使其失去行动能力并受到持续伤害。伤害量为基础伤害加上帕吉力量值的一定百分比，帕吉将回复与伤害量相等的生命。帕吉会将该单位以每秒%pull_units_per_second%的速度向自身牵引，最多牵引%pull_distance_limit%距离。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Pudge chows down on an enemy unit, disabling it and dealing damage over time. Damage is increased by Pudge's Strength and heals him for the total amount. Pudge pulls the unit at a rate of %pull_units_per_second% units, up to a minimum of %pull_distance_limit% range.", "notes_zh": ["即使肢解的目标在受到作用的过程中隐身，还是不会脱离肢解的作用。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["dismember_damage", "strength_damage", "ticks", "pull_units_per_second", "pull_distance_limit", "animation_rate", "shard_regen_pct", "order_lock_duration", "shard_cast_range", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "razor_plasma_field", "name_zh": "雷泽·等离子场", "name_en": "Plasma Field", "description_zh": "释放一波威力随扩张程度提升的等离子能量场，收缩时也会对经过的敌人造成伤害和减速。距离雷泽越远，伤害和减速越高。等离子场对每个单位造成两次伤害。", "description_en": "Releases a wave of energetic plasma that grows in power as it expands, but also zaps on contraction, slowing and dealing damage to enemy units caught in its path. Damage and slow increases with distance from Razor. The Plasma Field hits each unit twice, once each direction.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_min", "damage_max", "radius", "total_ability_time", "slow_min", "slow_max", "slow_duration", "second_ring_delay", "second_ring_reduction", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
